#: agent/src/backends.rs:248
msgid "The desktop is asking whether Rinflow may capture input"
msgstr "桌面正在询问是否允许 Rinflow 捕获输入"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:253
msgid ""
"Permission to capture input was not given. This device can't control others "
"until it is requested again and allowed."
msgstr "没有获得捕获输入的许可。本机不能控制其他设备，直到重新请求并允许。"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:285
msgid "The desktop is asking whether Rinflow may control this device"
msgstr "桌面正在询问是否允许 Rinflow 控制本机"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:294
msgid ""
"Permission to control this device was not given. Other devices can't control "
"it until it is requested again and allowed."
msgstr "没有获得控制本机的许可。其他设备不能控制本机，直到重新请求并允许。"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:340
msgid "Connecting to the desktop's input capture portal…"
msgstr "正在连接桌面的输入捕获门户…"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:371
msgid "Connecting input playback…"
msgstr "正在连接输入注入…"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:396
msgid ""
"In Gaming Mode this device can be controlled by others, but can't control "
"them."
msgstr "游戏模式下本机只能被其他设备控制，不能控制别的设备。"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:400
msgid "X11 sessions aren't supported yet; use a Wayland session."
msgstr "X11 会话暂不支持；请使用 Wayland 会话。"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:405
msgid "No graphical session was found."
msgstr "没有找到图形会话。"

#: agent/src/main.rs:301
msgid ""
"Rinflow couldn't use UDP port {port}; another copy of Rinflow may be "
"running. Choose another port in Settings, then restart the agent. ({detail})"
msgstr ""
"Rinflow 无法使用 UDP 端口 {port}（可能有另一个 Rinflow 正在运行）。请在“设置”"
"里换一个端口，然后重新启动后台服务。（{detail}）"

#: agent/src/main.rs:305
msgid "Rinflow's core didn't start: {detail}"
msgstr "Rinflow 核心没有启动：{detail}"

#: agent/src/services.rs:37
msgid "launch_at_login must be true or false"
msgstr "launch_at_login 需要 true 或 false"

#: agent/src/services.rs:39
msgid "Couldn't change “Start when I sign in”: {error}"
msgstr "无法设置“登录时启动”：{error}"

#: agent/src/services.rs:103
msgid "The core is shutting down"
msgstr "核心正在关闭"

#: app/src/agent.rs:119
msgid "The agent couldn't be started: {error}"
msgstr "无法启动后台服务：{error}"

#: app/src/agent.rs:125
msgid "The agent isn't answering ({error})"
msgstr "后台服务没有响应（{error}）"

#: app/src/agent.rs:153
msgid ""
"The agent and this window are different versions; update both ({version} / "
"{protocol})"
msgstr "后台服务和窗口版本不一致，请同时更新两者（{version} / {protocol}）"

#: app/src/canvas.rs:287
msgid "This device"
msgstr "本机"

#: app/src/main.rs:93
msgid "Use one mouse and keyboard across your computers."
msgstr "用一套键鼠操作你的所有电脑。"

