msgid "Added by address"
msgstr "通过地址添加"

#: app/src/window.rs:530
msgid "Remove this address"
msgstr "移除这个地址"

#: app/src/window.rs:555
msgid "Nothing nearby"
msgstr "附近没有设备"

#: app/src/window.rs:556
msgid "Open Rinflow on another device on this network, or add it by address."
msgstr "在同一网络的另一台设备上打开 Rinflow，或者通过地址添加它。"

#: app/src/window.rs:574
msgid "Waiting for the other device to confirm…"
msgstr "等待对方确认…"

#. Translators: {name} is the other device's name.
#: app/src/window.rs:582
msgid "Pair with {name}"
msgstr "与 {name} 配对"

#: app/src/window.rs:583
msgid ""
"Check that the other device shows the same six digits, then accept on both."
msgstr "确认对方屏幕上显示同样的六位数字，然后在两边都点接受。"

#: app/src/window.rs:595
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "拒绝"

#: app/src/window.rs:597
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "接受"

#. Translators: {name} is a device's name.
#: app/src/window.rs:643
msgid "Forget {name}?"
msgstr "忘记 {name}？"

#: app/src/window.rs:644
msgid ""
"It is disconnected, unplaced and unpaired. It shows up again as a nearby "
"device while it is online."
msgstr "它会被断开、移除放置并取消配对。它在线时会重新出现在附近的设备里。"

#: app/src/window.rs:647 app/src/window.rs:673
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: app/src/window.rs:648
msgid "Forget"
msgstr "忘记"

#: app/src/window.rs:664
msgid "Add a Device by Address"
msgstr "通过地址添加设备"

#: app/src/window.rs:665
msgid ""
"For networks that don't carry discovery (guest Wi-Fi, VPNs): the other "
"device's IP address or name. Only one of the two needs the other's address."
msgstr ""
"用于不传递发现广播的网络（访客 Wi-Fi、VPN）：填对方的 IP 地址或设备名。两台设"
"备里只需要一台填另一台的地址。"

#: app/src/window.rs:669
msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

#: app/src/window.rs:674 data/ui/window.blp:119
msgid "Add"
msgstr "添加"

#: app/src/window.rs:715
msgid "Ready: move the pointer off the edge toward a placed device."
msgstr "就绪：把指针推出屏幕边缘，朝向已放置的设备。"

#: app/src/window.rs:717
msgid "Ready: placed devices can move their pointer here."
msgstr "就绪：已放置的设备可以把指针移到本机。"

#: app/src/window.rs:725
msgid "Connecting to the desktop…"
msgstr "正在连接桌面…"

#: app/src/window.rs:747 data/ui/window.blp:152
msgid ""
"Text and images copied here go along when the pointer moves to another "
"device, and come back with it."
msgstr "在本机复制的文字和图片会随指针一起移到另一台设备，回来时也会带回来。"

#: app/src/window.rs:749
msgid ""
"This desktop doesn't share its clipboard with Rinflow. It needs the "
"clipboard portal (GNOME 45 or Plasma 6.2 and newer)."
msgstr ""
"此桌面没有向 Rinflow 提供剪贴板，需要剪贴板门户（GNOME 45 或 Plasma 6.2 及更"
"新版本）。"

#: app/src/window.rs:751
msgid ""
"Available once other devices may control this one: the clipboard comes with "
"that permission."
msgstr "允许其他设备控制本机后即可使用：剪贴板随这项权限一起授予。"

