#: shell/src/settings.rs:98
msgid "Settings couldn't be read"
msgstr "设置无法读取"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:102
msgid "Unknown setting: {key}"
msgstr "未知的设置项：{key}"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:107
msgid "Invalid setting value: {error}"
msgstr "设置的值无效：{error}"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:110
msgid "Theme must be system, light, or dark"
msgstr "主题只能是跟随系统、浅色或深色"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:113
msgid "Language must be system, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, or English"
msgstr "语言只能是跟随系统、简体中文、日语或英语"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:119
msgid "Ports must be between 1024 and 65535 and not the discovery port {port}"
msgstr "端口需在 1024–65535 之间，且不能是发现端口 {port}"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:124
msgid "You can add up to {count} addresses"
msgstr "最多添加 {count} 个地址"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:131
msgid ""
"“{address}” isn't a valid address. Enter an IP address or a device name."
msgstr "“{address}”不是有效的地址：请输入 IP 地址或设备名称。"

#: shell/src/settings.rs:134
msgid ""
"Pointer speed must be between 0.25× and 4×, and scroll speed between 0.25× "
"and 5×"
msgstr "指针速度需在 0.25–4 倍之间，滚动速度在 0.25–5 倍之间"

#. Translators: {name} is a device's name, {message} why it disconnected.
#: shell/src/state.rs:472
msgid "{name}: {message}"
msgstr "{name}：{message}"

#: shell/src/state.rs:535
msgid ""
"The other device stopped responding (it may be asleep or offline). It "
"reconnects when it's back."
msgstr "对方没有响应（可能睡眠了或断网），回来后会自动重新连接。"

#: shell/src/state.rs:536
msgid ""
"The other device refused the connection. It may have removed this device, or "
"it only allows paired devices. To pair again, select Connect in the device "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"对方拒绝了连接：对方可能移除了本机，或只允许已配对的设备。在设备菜单里点“连"
"接”可以重新配对。"

#: shell/src/state.rs:537
msgid ""
"The device's identity certificate changed, so the connection was refused. If "
"it was reinstalled, remove it in the device menu and pair again."
msgstr ""
"设备的身份证书变了，已拒绝连接。如果对方重装过，请在设备菜单里选择“忘记此设"
"备”，然后重新配对。"

#: shell/src/state.rs:539
msgid "The other device declined pairing."
msgstr "对方拒绝了配对。"

#: shell/src/state.rs:541
msgid "Pairing timed out. It wasn't confirmed within two minutes."
msgstr "配对超时，没有在两分钟内确认。"

#: shell/src/state.rs:542
msgid "An unpaired device was disconnected (“Only paired devices” is on)."
msgstr "未配对的设备已断开（已开启“仅允许已配对的设备”）。"

#: shell/src/state.rs:543
msgid "Unpaired."
msgstr "已取消配对。"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.desktop.in:3
msgid "Rinflow"
msgstr "Rinflow"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.desktop.in:4
msgid "Mouse and keyboard sharing"
msgstr "键鼠共享"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.desktop.in:5 data/com.rinflow.linux.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Use one mouse and keyboard across your computers"
msgstr "用一套键鼠操作你的所有电脑"

#. Translators: search terms, separated by semicolons and ending with one. Keep the English ones and add your own.
#: data/com.rinflow.linux.desktop.in:11
msgid "kvm;mouse;keyboard;share;cursor;"
msgstr "kvm;mouse;keyboard;share;cursor;键鼠;鼠标;键盘;共享;光标;"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Move the pointer off the edge of this screen and it appears on the computer "
"next to it: a Mac, a Windows PC, another Linux machine or a Steam Deck. The "
"keyboard follows. Every connection is encrypted and new devices pair with a "
"six-digit code."
msgstr ""
"把指针推出屏幕边缘，它就出现在旁边那台电脑上：Mac、Windows、另一台 Linux 或 "
"Steam Deck，键盘随之切换。所有连接都加密，新设备用六位配对码配对。"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"On GNOME and KDE the desktop asks once whether Rinflow may capture and play "
"input. In Steam Deck's Gaming Mode this device can be controlled by others."
msgstr ""
"在 GNOME 和 KDE 上，桌面会询问一次是否允许 Rinflow 捕获和注入输入。在 Steam "
"Deck 的游戏模式下，本机可以被其他设备控制。"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Optionally the clipboard goes along: text and images copied on one computer "
"can be pasted on the next."
msgstr "还可以同步剪贴板：在一台电脑上复制的文字和图片，可以在下一台上粘贴。"

#: data/com.rinflow.linux.metainfo.xml.in:42
msgid ""
"First Linux release: GNOME and KDE on Wayland through the input portals, "
"Steam Deck Gaming Mode as a controlled device, and clipboard sharing (text, "
"HTML and images) through the clipboard portal."
msgstr ""
"首个 Linux 版本：通过输入门户支持 Wayland 上的 GNOME 和 KDE，在 Steam Deck 游"
"戏模式下可作为被控设备，并通过剪贴板门户同步剪贴板（文字、HTML 和图片）。"
